---
title: Card payment
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    box Shop system
        participant W as Web shop
        participant O as Order Service
        participant DB as Orders DB
    end
    participant S as Stripe
    participant Q as order-events queue

    C->>W: Pay for order
    W->>+O: POST /orders/42/pay
    O->>O: Check stock and prices
    O->>+S: Create payment intent
    S-->>-O: client secret
    O-->>-W: 202 Accepted
    Note over W,S: The browser confirms the card with 3-D Secure
    alt payment succeeded
        S-)O: webhook payment_intent.succeeded
        O->>+DB: UPDATE status = paid
        DB-->>-O: ok
        O-)Q: OrderPaid
    else card declined
        S-)O: webhook payment_failed
        O->>DB: UPDATE status = failed
    end
    loop every 2 s until paid or failed
        W->>O: GET /orders/42
        O-->>W: status
    end
    W-->>C: Order confirmation
